{"id":"13c94185789a6bef","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-strict-minimization.md","title":"部分函数的严格最小化","display":"df-strict-minimization — 部分函数的严格最小化","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-strict-minimization","aliases":["20-df-strict-minimization"],"display":"df-strict-minimization — 部分函数的严格最小化","chapter":"1","section":"1.5","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"definition-checked","source_reference":"Theorem 1.5.7 的算子化；Exercise 1.6.28","source_printed_pages":[13,19],"source_pdf_pages":[49,55],"depends_on":["[[20-df-partial-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-strict-minimization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-strict-minimization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-strict-minimization — 部分函数的严格最小化"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"section","html":"1.5"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-checked"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 1.5.7 的算子化；Exercise 1.6.28"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>13</span><span>19</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>49</span><span>55</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3f7915f8f8ad037c\" href=\"?note=3f7915f8f8ad037c\" title=\"20-df-partial-function\">20-df-partial-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta:\\omega^2\\rightharpoonup\\omega\">\\(\\theta:\\omega^2\\rightharpoonup\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in\\omega\">\\(x,y\\in\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3f7915f8f8ad037c\" href=\"?note=3f7915f8f8ad037c\" title=\"20-df-partial-function\">20-df-partial-function</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}strict\\text{-}minimization}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Min}_1(\\theta)(x)\\downarrow=y\\Longleftrightarrow \\theta(x,y)\\downarrow=1\\land\\forall z&lt;y\\ \\exists v\\ne1\\ [\\theta(x,z)\\downarrow=v].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}strict\\text{-}minimization}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Min}_1(\\theta)(x)\\downarrow=y\\Longleftrightarrow \\theta(x,y)\\downarrow=1\\land\\forall z&lt;y\\ \\exists v\\ne1\\ [\\theta(x,z)\\downarrow=v].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>较小输入上的停止且非 1 是定义域条件。两个不同 y 不可能同时满足式子：较大候选会要求较小候选非 1。没有这样的 y 时算子未定义；它不等同于忽略较小发散输入的“最小命中”。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 1.5.7 的算子化；Exercise 1.6.28；印刷页 13, 19；PDF 第 49, 55 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-partial-function","status":"resolved","id":"3f7915f8f8ad037c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-partial-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-partial-function","status":"resolved","id":"3f7915f8f8ad037c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-partial-function]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\theta:\\omega^2\\rightharpoonup\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"x,y\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}strict\\text{-}minimization}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Min}_1(\\theta)(x)\\downarrow=y\\Longleftrightarrow \\theta(x,y)\\downarrow=1\\land\\forall z<y\\ \\exists v\\ne1\\ [\\theta(x,z)\\downarrow=v].","display":true}],"bytes":1315,"backlinks":[{"id":"81368c4ce6d48f51","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-K]]；see [[20-thm-K-undecidable]]；see [[20-df-strict-minimization]]。"},{"id":"d4534f52872ace1d","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-strict-minimization]]；see [[20-df-computable]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]。"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-strict-minimization]] — 章 1；直接提供者 1 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-strict-minimization]]"}],"outgoing":["3f7915f8f8ad037c"]}